---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Book a Call
eyebrow: Services
subtitle: Tell me about your publication and pick a few times that work. I'll reply personally within one business day to confirm a slot.
permalink: /book-a-call/
narrow: true
centered: true
---
<div class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto var(--space-lg); text-align: center;">
  Calls are 30 minutes on Zoom. No sales pitch, no pressure, just a conversation about what you're building and whether I'm the right person to help you build it. If I'm not, I'll say so and point you somewhere better.
</div>

<form class="form" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
  <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ meta.web3formsKey }}">
  <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New call booking">
  <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="{{ meta.title }}">
  <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="{{ meta.url }}/thank-you/">
  <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

  <div class="form__row">
    <label class="form__label form__label--required" for="name">Your name</label>
    <input class="form__input" id="name" name="name" type="text" required>
  </div>
  <div class="form__row">
    <label class="form__label form__label--required" for="email">Email</label>
    <input class="form__input" id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
  </div>
  <div class="form__row">
    <label class="form__label" for="publication">Publication name or idea</label>
    <input class="form__input" id="publication" name="publication" type="text" placeholder="The Example Dispatch">
  </div>
  <div class="form__row">
    <label class="form__label" for="package">Interest</label>
    <select class="form__select" id="package" name="package">
      <option value="undecided">Not sure yet</option>
      <option value="launch">Launch, $499</option>
      <option value="signature">Signature, $1,499</option>
      <option value="publisher">Publisher, $3,499</option>
      <option value="migration">Migration only</option>
      <option value="hosting">Monthly hosting</option>
      <option value="care">Care plan</option>
      <option value="custom">Custom / other</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <fieldset class="fieldset">
    <legend>Pick a few times that work</legend>
    <p class="form__hint" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Give me two or three date/time options (include your time zone) and I'll confirm one. If none of them work when I reply, I'll propose a few more over email.</p>
    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label" for="slot1">Option 1</label>
      <input class="form__input" id="slot1" name="slot_1" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Tuesday May 5, 10am MT">
    </div>
    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label" for="slot2">Option 2</label>
      <input class="form__input" id="slot2" name="slot_2" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Wednesday May 6, 2pm MT">
    </div>
    <div class="form__row">
      <label class="form__label" for="slot3">Option 3</label>
      <input class="form__input" id="slot3" name="slot_3" type="text" placeholder="Optional">
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="form__row">
    <label class="form__label" for="notes">Anything else I should know before the call?</label>
    <textarea class="form__textarea" id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="Goals, timeline, current platform, or anything else that would help me prepare."></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="form__actions">
    <button class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" type="submit">Request a call</button>
  </div>
</form>

{% include "partials/form-note.njk" %}
